$Q($cSpatial, 3, 'NEUTRAL', 'A site’s existing road access is narrow, but the proposed building requires fire-service access and regular deliveries. What should be checked?', 'Turning, width, clearance, surface, timing, emergency reliability, pedestrian separation, and the authority requirements.', ['Assume emergency vehicles can use any route.', 'Use the narrow road because it already exists.', 'Move deliveries to the accessible entrance.', 'Measure only the building setback.'], 'Access must work for actual vehicles and users. Existing access is evidence, not proof of adequacy.', 'service access', 'PREREQUISITE_FREE', false, 'narrow-road-service', 'vehicle access', true, ['existing equals adequate']);
